BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 772.0 Td (Apply on the PMAY-Urban portal or through your urban local body.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 753.0 Td (What should I bring?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 739.0 Td (Aadhaar of all family members, Income certificate, Bank account. Bring them in person; never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 725.0 Td (read document numbers out on the phone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 706.0 Td (Do I have to pay to apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 692.0 Td (There is no fee to apply. Any premium or contribution is only what is stated under What it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 678.0 Td (gives. Never pay anyone or share an OTP to apply.) Tj ET
